Subject: [PATCH 2/2] keystore2: add maintenance keybox management

Expose setKeyboxXml and getKeyboxStatus on IKeystoreMaintenance restricted to SYSTEM_UID so system_server can validate and persist keybox.xml through keystore2 without relaxing keystore_data_file sepolicy.

Change-Id: I2bb1e6a1c915fd948c9c084e7ef1a84316e64bff

